# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Language-stat policy (transparent — nothing hidden, everything stays in the
# tree with the rationale documented right here).
#
# The MODULE itself is Rust: src/, cplug-abi/, cplug-sdk/, native/,
# area-map-fuzz/. Everything excluded below falls into four honest buckets:
#
# 1) Kernel-derived Java bridge material (sources + compiled payloads that are
#    embedded into the module via include_bytes! and hot-patched into the
#    kernel at runtime). It mirrors kernel/Moonrise/vanilla package trees and
#    follows kernel build conventions — it is not module code.
# 2) Vendored third-party dependencies (ASM, the ECJ compiler).
# 3) Benchmark suites and measurement harnesses (bench/p500 carries the P500
#    provenance license; bench/ab + bench/world3 are bench drivers).
# 4) Prose (documentation, reports, worklogs).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
bridges/**        linguist-vendored
# fixtures + kernel-coupled smoke/fuzz harnesses
tests/**          linguist-vendored
# kernel-coupled alloc-diet java harness
allocdiet/**      linguist-vendored
# SDK asm-build fixtures
cplug-sdk/asm-src/** linguist-vendored
cplug-sdk/asm-lib/*.jar linguist-vendored
cplug-sdk/asm-build/**  linguist-vendored
tools/*.jar       linguist-vendored
bench/**          linguist-vendored
# kernel-coupled rebuild recipes for bucket (1)
scripts/**        linguist-vendored
*.md              linguist-documentation

# Binaries are not source.
*.so    binary
*.jar   binary
*.zip   binary
*.class binary
*.jfr   binary
